<title>USA: Chesapeake Utilities chairman to step down.</title>
<headline>Chesapeake Utilities chairman to step down.</headline>
<dateline>DOVER, Del. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chesapeake Utilities Corp said John Jardine will step down as chairman effective August 1 but will remain as an active member of the board.</p>
<p>The company said he will be succeeded as chairman by Ralph Adkins, who wil continue to be chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Adkins will be succeeded as president by John Schimkatitis, who continues to be chief operating officer.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
